      "code": "if (!p11_rpc_buffer_get_uint32 (buffer, offset, &count))",
      "role": "intermediate",
      "note": "Because the outer attribute type is CKA_WRAP_TEMPLATE, its value is decoded as an attribute array and the nested count is read from the input."
    },
    {
