      "var": "attrs[i].pValue",
      "code": "attrs[i].pValue = p11_rpc_message_alloc_extra (msg, temp.ulValueLen);",
      "role": "intermediate",
      "note": "The server allocates only temp.ulValueLen bytes for the outer template value; with one nested attribute this is 24 bytes."
    },
    {
      "step": 6,
      "file": "p11-kit/p11-kit/rpc-message.c",
      "function": "p11_rpc_buffer_get_byte_array_value",
      "line": 1216,
      "var": "value",
      "code": "memcpy (value, val, len);",
      "role": "sink",
      "note": "During the second decode pass, the nested CKA_LABEL byte array copies the PoC-controlled 64-byte value through a pointer inside the undersized 24-byte outer allocation."
